            <ArticleTitle>[Treatment of patients with ischemic heart disease in the initial stage of heart failure using strophanthin electrophoresis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>52-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It was established that strophanthine electrophoresis produced a positive inotropic effect associated with a pronounced improvement of the peripheral blood flow. It is concluded that strophantine electrophoresis is indicated as a method of maintenance treatment in patients with cardiac insufficiency.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
